// REJECTS: 'AuthenticationDemo' is not a known section parser
//
// A third way legend-engine declares surface it will not accept, distinct from both dead
// tokens and walker-rejection. The tokens ARE referenced by rules in
// AuthenticationParserGrammar, and those rules parse -- what is missing is the SectionParser
// that would route text to the grammar at all. AuthenticationDemoParserExtension registers
// ###AuthenticationDemo and lives in src/test/java, so it is absent from the shipped jar.
